## Navigation Strategy

- Use built-in `Navigator` first
- Prepare for `go_router` future adoption
- Support deep linking when needed
- Implement simple navigation patterns
- Handle authentication redirects
- Organize routes by feature
- Use typed route parameters
- Support web URLs when required

## Built-in Navigation Patterns

- Use `Navigator.push()` for forward navigation
- Apply `Navigator.pop()` to return
- Use `Navigator.pushReplacement()` for replacement
- Apply `Navigator.pushAndRemoveUntil()` for clearing
- Pass typed parameters through constructors
- Handle route results with `await`
- Use `super.key` in route widgets

```dart
// Monica app navigation pattern
class WelcomeScreen extends StatelessWidget {
  const WelcomeScreen({super.key});

  void _navigateToHome(BuildContext context) {
    Navigator.push(
      context,
      MaterialPageRoute<void>(
        builder: (context) => const HomeScreen(),
      ),
    );
  }

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) => Scaffold(
    // ... UI implementation
  );
}
```

